@startuml
!theme plain
actor Dispatcher
participant "Send Dialog" as UI
participant "Entry API\nRouteSendController" as API
participant "RouteSendService" as SVC
database "MySQL" as DB

title S-1/S-4 Send route to driver

Dispatcher -> UI: Pick route, driver, revision (default latest)
UI -> API: POST /api/v1/routes/{id}/send {driverUserId}
API -> SVC: send(routeId, driverUserId)
SVC -> DB: Load route + stops, driver user, solution
alt route empty / driver not DRIVER / branch mismatch / status INFEASIBLE
  SVC --> API: 400/404/422 + ErrorDetail
  API --> UI: Error toast, dialog stays open, nothing persisted
else concurrent send lost (F-S1 409)
  SVC --> API: 409 + winning send id
  API --> UI: Reload offer, dialog keeps selection
else valid
  SVC -> DB: Flip prior CURRENT sends of route -> SUPERSEDED
  SVC -> DB: Insert RouteSend (CURRENT)
  SVC --> API: Send record
  API --> UI: Success + assignee shown
end

note over SVC,DB: Validate -> flip -> insert is atomic:\nfailed validation flips nothing (F-S3).
@enduml
